  "evidence": [
    "Pinned join_service62E2B6..62E2DC copies ServiceStruct+8 GUID into Net+6EC with four interleaved DWORD pairs. DirectPlayCreate receives original source GUID pointer. close62E21C..62E226 clears16 bytes; ctor62D6A0..62D8DC omits field stores. create_session62EAA0 compares serial671800 before modem6717F0. Distinct application GUID pointer+6E8 stays unchanged.",
    "Verify native GUID layout and copy lowering under both configured profiles. Preserve original quirks, constructor omission, clear ordering and all source identities/claims. No compiler policy changes or task reset. Scoped manual integration requires independent review, full build/link, affected TU measurements and fixture closure."
  ],
